// Cloudflare Workers config, deploying this site as pure static assets.
//
// Unlike ppo-site there is no Worker script here: this site has no forms and no
// API routes, so there is nothing to run at request time. The data is baked in
// at build time by tools/fetch.py, and Cloudflare just serves public/.
//
// Build command in the Cloudflare dashboard (Settings > Build) must run BOTH
// steps, in this order:
//
//     python tools/fetch.py && hugo
//
// If the build only runs `hugo`, the site still deploys -- with whatever stale
// JSON was committed to data/pl/. That fails silently and looks fine, so it is
// worth checking the "Updated" stamp in the page header after a deploy.
{
  "name": "pl-dashboard",
  "compatibility_date": "2026-08-01",
  "observability": {
    "enabled": true
  },
  "assets": {
    "directory": "./public"
  }
}
